title: "Realtime Retrospective Board: AI Model Benchmark Dataset and Evaluation Artifacts"
abstract: "Dataset, scoring rubric, implementation artifacts and analysis code from a matched, replicated comparison of 90 agentic code-generation runs implementing a standardized real-time retrospective board application, evaluated across model generations, two agent harnesses, reasoning-effort levels, a visual automation and testing tool, and a design-oriented prompt condition. The archive contains every run's source, screenshots and rubric, the analysis code, and the one-paragraph design directive written for the study; the third-party agent prompt used in the full-prompt condition is not included."
